fied by UDOT. The most recent update was completed in October 2025.</p><p><strong>Data Fields and Descriptions:</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Trail_Name:</strong> Name of the trail segment or official project name.</li><li><strong>Trail_Status:</strong> Indicates whether the trail is existing or proposed.</li><li><strong>UTN_Flag:</strong> Identifies whether the segment meets the Utah Trail Network criteria.</li><li><strong>UDOT_Region:</strong> Corresponding UDOT administrative region.</li><li><strong>UTN_ProjectType:</strong> Classification of the project type (e.g., Base Network, Gap Closure, etc.).</li><li><strong>Miles:</strong> Segment length in miles.</li></ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Data Management and Contacts:</strong><br />This data layer is maintained by the Utah Department of Transportation (UDOT).<br />For questions regarding the data, please contact the <strong>UDOT Trails Division</strong> at <a href='mailto:utahtrailnetwork@utah.gov' rel='nofollow ugc'><strong>utahtrailnetwork@utah.gov</strong></a>.</p><p><strong>Related Resources:</strong><br />This layer is a component of the <a target='_blank' href='https://uplan.maps.arcgis.com/home/item.html?id=a8f9dc1c90234d558869d513fb3910d4' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'><strong>Utah Trail Network Web Application</strong></a><strong>.</strong></p><p><strong>Special Characteristics:</strong><br />This service is a <strong>draft planning layer</strong> and is not intended for engineering or construction purposes.</p>","licenseInfo":"<p style='font-weight:bold;'>This data is for informational purposes and must be field verified prior to being used on a project.</p><p>UDOT makes no warranty with respect to the accuracy, completeness or usefulness of this content or consequential damages resulting from the use or misuse of the content or any of the information contained herein. Please contact the UDOT GIS Department at <a href='mailto:udotgis@utah.gov' rel='nofollow ugc'>udotgis@utah.gov</a> for more infor